{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is sensed then approach, pick up, check properties, and do a specific task. Otherwise, scan or move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTargetObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSensed    />",
